  "body_text": "意式类兴趣课程第3期来咯～\n课程中会以我们的吧台为例来介绍“意式咖啡”，它的\n构成\n，每一部分的\n职能\n，如何\n操作\n到制作一杯我们\n菜单\n上的意式类咖啡饮品。\n课程将\n不设置ppt，纯人声互动式体验\n等你来！\n【有容乃大】兴趣课程\n意式咖啡\n课程要点：\n了解意式咖啡\n意式咖啡器具与用豆介绍\n意式咖啡制作流程（含拉花）\n演示与实际操作练习\n互相品鉴与讨论\n课程目标：了解意式吧台的方方面面与菜单上的品名，通过实际操作与感官感受讨论来获得对意式咖啡更全面的了解。\n时间（2小时）：3月20日 周六 10:30 - 12:30\n人数：4 - 6 人 小班\n讲师：小塔\n地点：上海市静安区南京西路1038号梅龙镇广场伊势丹百货5F\n有容乃大咖啡吧台\n这回课上会用到的豆子，\nOlive (浅焙)\nEmpty Tank (中深焙)\nLucky Draw RumChoco (深焙)\n点击👉报名",
  "body_html": "<div class=\"rich_media_content js_underline_content\" id=\"js_content\" style=\"visibility: hidden; opacity: 0; \">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          意式类兴趣课程第3期来咯～\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          课程中会以我们的吧台为例来介绍“意式咖啡”，它的\n          <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">\n<strong>\n            构成\n           </strong>\n</span>\n          ，每一部分的\n          <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">\n<strong>\n            职能\n           </strong>\n</span>\n          ，如何\n          <strong>\n<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">\n            操作\n           </span>\n</strong>\n          到制作一杯我们\n          <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">\n<strong>\n            菜单\n           </strong>\n</span>\n          上的意式类咖啡饮品。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          课程将\n          <em>\n<strong>\n            不设置ppt，纯人声互动式体验\n           </strong>\n</em>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          等你来！\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          【有容乃大】兴趣课程\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          意式咖啡\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          课程要点：\n         </span>\n</section>\n<blockquote style=\"white-space: normal;\">\n<ol class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"width: 564.75px;list-style-type: lower-roman;\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n            了解意式咖啡\n           </section>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n            意式咖啡器具与用豆介绍\n           </section>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n            意式咖啡制作流程（含拉花）\n           </section>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n            演示与实际操作练习\n           </section>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n            互相品鉴与讨论\n           </section>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</blockquote>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          课程目标：了解意式吧台的方方面面与菜单上的品名，通过实际操作与感官感受讨论来获得对意式咖啡更全面的了解。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          时间（2小时）：3月20日 周六 10:30 - 12:30\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          人数：4 - 6 人 小班\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          讲师：小塔\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          地点：上海市静安区南京西路1038号梅龙镇广场伊势丹百货5F\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          有容乃大咖啡吧台\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          这回课上会用到的豆子，\n         </span>\n</p>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<p>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            Olive (浅焙)\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<p>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            Empty Tank (中深焙)\n           </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<p>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            Lucky Draw RumChoco (深焙)\n           </span>\n<br/>\n</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<a data-linktype=\"2\" href=\"https://j.youzan.com/OpS4ds\" tab=\"outerlink\" target=\"_blank\" textvalue=\"点击👉报名\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           点击👉报名\n          </span>\n</a>\n</section>\n</div>",
